Description & Requirements

Who we are looking for

We are currently looking for a talented .NET developer to work in our young and dynamic team, developing usable, fast and reliable software for the financial industry. Our company offers the financial stability of a multinational company, while our development team is a quite independent, technology focused group with great tech people and flexible leaders. Join us to become an even more professional developer and help us develop amazing software.

You need:

At least 4 years of hands-on experience in C# and .NET development (leveraging technologies such as C#, .NET 8, Web API, EF Core, MSSQL, Azure AI and more);
Familiarity with web development frameworks and tools (our stack includes Typescript, Angular and Kendo);
Proficient in database management and ORMs, with a solid understanding of best practices in data handling;
Strong collaboration and communication skills, capable of working effectively in a team while independently managing tasks with responsibility and attention to detail.

Your future role

As a developer in our team you will:

Work with the latest technologies in the .NET and web domain;
Write code of new features 80% of your time;
Participate in all areas of the software development (design, coding, performance and security assessment, automated testing etc);
Work in protected sprints in a well refined SCRUM environment;
Analyze and resolve programming issues;
Learn from the more senior colleagues, move along a clear and structured career path;
Benefit from the company’s training program in your preferred tech areas;
Belong to a team where we help each other to reach the company’s and your personal goals;
Have fun - we organize regular team events!

What we offer

Hybrid working environment - home office days are allowed;
Competitive salary including a wide range of benefits and performance bonus;
The most recent technologies and integrated development components;
Mentoring and technical coaching from senior developers;
Challenging multinational environment, where personal development and growth are encouraged;
Several training programs are available during your career;
Fresh fruit every day and quality coffee are provided for healthy and energized working days;
Attractive and modern working environment.

Selection process

If your resume is of interest to us, the recruitment will consist of several stages:

Short online interview with Talent Acquisition Specialist;
Interviews with members of the team.

About Deloitte

Deloitte is a variety of people, experience, industries and services we deliver in 150 countries of the world. It is an intellectual challenge, a good starting point for your career, and an excellent opportunity for continuous development and gaining valuable life experiences. What you only must do is to take the first step - press the apply button and send us your CV, go through all the stages of the recruitment process and sign a contract with us. Deloitte is simply your best choice.

